WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.980
<b>Physical Fitness Test Today</b>

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.240
'Sup, Irido Mizuto-kun?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.750
Wanna stick together during 
the fitness test today?

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.420
Let me just tell you this.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.870
There's nothing to gain in befriending me.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:26.710
Why, you ask?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.840
You're so evidently the player type

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.420
that there's no way in hell
 I'd let you anywhere near Yume.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.850
Of course. I expected as much.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.260
What are you on about?

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.960
Oh, nothing. Just talking to myself.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.020
I'm Kawanami Kogure.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.190
And I'm the first guy who's 
genuinely trying to befriend you.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.510
That just makes you 
 even more suspicious.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.480
Don't be like that, bro.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.020
I don't recall being related to you.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.040
Too bad. Friends it is, then.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:00.970
The pleasure's mine.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:02.780
Have you no concept of boundaries?

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:05.980
Now then, pal,

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:10.960
to celebrate our newfound friendship, 
why don't I let you in on a little something?

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:12.780
And that would be?

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:16.550
If you turn around, you'll see 
something truly incredible.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.560
"There's no way in hell I'd let 
you anywhere near Yume,"

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:22.720
was it?

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.370
<b>My Stepmom's 
Daughter Is 
My Ex</b>

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.150
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:00.150
Okay, stop there.

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.160
All right, next person in line.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.290
Try to keep the chatter
 to a minimum, you hear?

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:09.040
<b>My Ex Needs Taking Care Of</b>

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:09.040
<b>"Thirty-Eight Degrees, Apparently"</b>

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.800
<i>Isn't this girl in my class?</i>

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:23.100
<i>I think her name was Minami Akatsuki...</i>

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.550
U-Um...

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:27.850
What is it?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.400
Whoops, my bad, my bad.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.360
I was just thinking, you've got a big bust 
for someone with such a petite figure.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.320
I mean, look. This is all 
I've got going for me.

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:45.080
All taking measurements does is 
remind me how much I <i>haven't</i> grown.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:48.830
So I get depressed whenever 
this time of year rolls around.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.980
I feel that. I've definitely been there.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:54.330
Just last year, mine weren't very big at all.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.590
What? They weren't?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.840
I'd say they were about the same 
size as yours last year.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.590
What?!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.100
You got that big in a year?!

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.440
O-On a side note...

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.900
Might I inquire as to
 your bra size, perchance?

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.040
Um...

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.240
Did you say <i>D</i>?

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:27.070
J-Just keep in mind that I like 
to go a size up, okay?

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.430
Wow!

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.830
You've given me hope, Irido-san!

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.850
Hey... M-Minami-san?!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.290
Don't they say the people you 
hang around rub off on you?

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.800
So if I stick to you like this, 
maybe mine'll get bigger too!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.390
Come on, come on!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.430
I don't think that's what 
that saying means...

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:55.140
Do we really have to do physical 
fitness tests even at prep school?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.160
Ugh, this totally sucks.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.150
I agree.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.840
<i>When I got into high school,</i>

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.510
<i>I made a conscious effort to change 
my looks and personality.</i>

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:08.260
<i>But when it comes to fitness...</i>

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:12.660
Well, Irido-san,
 let's just get this over with.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:15.620
Y-Yeah, let's.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.100
Yo, are you seeing this?

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:27.140
Minami's cracked!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.600
Dang! Only 55 jumps?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.140
I was hoping to do a little better than that.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.020
M-Minami-san...

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.270
I thought you said you 
weren't good at these things.

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:42.460
I didn't say I wasn't good at it.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.640
I just said that it sucks.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:49.180
Come on. If they see a short little
 girl like me beating the boys,

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.410
they'll start picking on me, y'know?

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:55.060
<i>Impressive misdirection.</i>

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.640
<i>I've finally established my 
image as a model student.</i>

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:06.470
<i>If they find out I suck at sports...</i>

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:10.010
<i>No, I won't let that happen. I can do this!</i>

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.600
One.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.590
Two.

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:19.370
Hmm?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.600
What's up, Irido?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.600
Three.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:21.880
I give up.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.110
That's not an option!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.110
<i>That boy's way too apathetic 
for his own good.</i>

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.110
<i>I mustn't fall so low.</i>

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.370
<b>Height

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.370
First Attempt:
First Attempt: 
Average:
Number:
First Attempt:
First Attempt: 35 
